ding will support the production of a unique high-intensity Eurobeat soundtrack with POWERHOUSE vocals and an original manga following ASUKA and her classmates! GET MORE THAN THE DEMO A higher Kickstarter tier also unlocks permanent access to EXPANDED beta b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T14:20:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036601","verified_at":"2026-10-23T17:10:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3357310-1846651706687321","game_id":"steam-3357310","kind":"update","title":"Demo Mini Patch 2","summary":"\\ CPU threads now capped to prevent crashes on certain devices with known issues with uncapped CPU threads.\\ Wheel permanently locked controller input issue resolved.\\ Low preset Main Menu lighting issue resolved.\\ Custom music import sped up(previously slow when importing custom tracks)\\ Airflow cooling multiplier increased(cooling now gets stronger with speed at a higher rate.)\\ Airflow cooling direction flipped(default value kept in the same place so the existing heat balance remains unchange","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T16:00:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687321","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3357310-1846651706679266","game_id":"steam-3357310","kind":"update","title":"Demo Mini Patch 1","summary":"\\ Settings arrow UI bug resolved.\\ HUD bug when controller disconnects resolved\\ Setup options now properly locked behind part progression.\\ Cars no longer get stuck in downshift/upshift oscillation between gears during Dyno runs.\\ FOV throttle input pumping issue resolved.\\ supercharger pulley no longer cuts boost to 0 bar.\\ Drive ratio now provides a fair power vs. heat trade-off.\\ Turbo Boost Control at max no longer removes all lag for free.\\ Boost Control now speeds up spool without ever ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T20:55:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679266","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3357310-1846651706675197","game_id":"steam-3357310","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: We are Listening!","summary":"Thank you to everyone who played the demo and took the time to leave a review. We read every feedback.1.0.1 Patch\\ Brake strength increased by 25% for all stock brakes. Upgrade levels remain balanced to account for the stock boost.\\ Foggy day weather density reduced.\\ Speed Sensitive Steering option reworked. now has levels Off, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5.\\ \"Steer Assist\" renamed to \"Steer Grip Limiter\" to better reflect its purpose and align with its tooltip description. now has levels Off, 1, 2, 3, 4, Full","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T17:53:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675197","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3357310-1846018067941571","game_id":"steam-3357310","kind":"announcement","title":"ASUKA x Redline Reverie The Public Demo Is Here!","summary":"The Public Demo Is Here!Hey everyone!The wait is over! ASUKA x Redline Reverie is now available to play on Steam!As promised, we're releasing the demo in October, just ahead of Steam Next Fest. This early release gives everyone a chance to try the game, get familiar with the driving, and share feedback before the event.Thank you to everyone who has followed our development, supported us on Patreon, tested and shared feedback, joined our Discord, or helped spread the word!Two Developers, One Big ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T16:40:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941571","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3357310-1837955055360790","game_id":"steam-3357310","kind":"announcement","title":"ASUKA Beta Demo Now Available on Patreon","summary":"ASUKA Beta Demo is Now Live on Patreon!Hey everyone!Today we're excited to launch the first playable ASUKA Beta Demo for our Patreon members.This early version includes:Haruna Mountain PassVehicle Tuning & UpgradesArashiyama Short CourseKanto Racing Circuit5 Chassis Our goal with this beta isn't simply to give early access. it's to gather feedback, squash bugs, improve performance, and polish the experience before everyone gets their hands on it.Public Demo Coming This OctoberIf you're waiting f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T09:43:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055360790","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3357310-1813041031248300","game_id":"steam-3357310","kind":"announcement","title":"ASUKA Patreon Announcement!","summary":"Thanks to all your amazing support, we’re so excited to share that ASUKA × Redline Reverie is officially launching a Patreon! ASUKA’s Patreon members will get: • Early access to playable builds. including alpha, beta and prologue versions • Patreon-exclusive polls via discord to help guide new content (cars, kits, and more) • Exclusive periodic character art drops to immerse you deeper into ASUKA’s world • The “ASUKA’s Pit Crew” Discord role. unlock a private channel to access some insider dev l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-10T18:11:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813041031248300","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3357310-1804977324455617","game_id":"steam-3357310","kind":"announcement","title":"Introducing ASUKA!","summary":"We’re thrilled to announce a new name and an upgraded character model for our game!Say hello to ASUKA x Redline Reverie, a title inspired by one of ASUKA's quirks: her fascination with a few things French! This theme is deeply woven into her character arc, and we can’t wait to show you how it unfolds through rich, story-driven gameplay.Thanks to your wonderful support early on, we’ve gained the confidence to invest even more into the project. That means a bigger art budget, a remodeled ASUKA, an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-11T18:22:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1804977324455617","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3357310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:58Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3357310":"2026-10-26T10:36:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3357310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:58Z"},"4106880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:58Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3357310","app_id":3357310,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:17Z","source_ur